<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0568_T23PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your homies know hidden moves?\rFainted just mean it ain’t got the\nenergy to scrap. Like me on Mondays.\rBut it can still use hidden moves\noutside battle! Like me on Fridays.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0568_T23PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill’s PC hold 30 homies per Box.\nThat’s a lotta roommates.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0568_T23PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know where Kurt gets his\nleather?\rBushes. He digs through BUSHES.\nGator hide, velvet, all of it.\rAnd people pay HUNDREDS for them\nbags.\fThe economy is broken.\n</language>
	</row>
</body>
